DESCRIPTION:Traditional and contemporary choral repertoire exploring the t
 heme Resonance: The Music Within. Featuring Vocal Accord and University S
 ingers with guest artists Maegan Hoogerhyde '20\, soprano soloist\, and t
 he University Wind Symphony in collaboration with University Singers for 
 the NJ Premiere of Jake Runestad's Vincent's Sky. Runestad captures van G
 ogh's emotional state surrounding three of his paintings\, influenced by 
 the poetry of Walt Whitman. Performed with supertitles and stunning visua
 ls.\nMontclair State University Students FREE with ID at Kasser Box Offic
 e\nLearn more about the Choral Area at Montclair's Cali School of Music\n
