DESCRIPTION:Join our Red Hawk Reality family for a spooky day of deception
 \, mystery\, and betrayal as we play our very own single-day version of T
 he Traitors! Meet new friends\, compete in challenges\, test your ability
  to spot a liar\, and see if you have what it takes to outwit the Traitor
 s hiding among you. \nCome dressed in your best spooky-season look\, grab
  some treats\, and get ready for a night full of secrets\, strategy\, and
  suspicion. Even if it's past Halloween\, one question will haunt you all
  night:\nWHO CAN YOU TRUST?\nHow to apply:\nFill out this interest form t
 o confirm your availability & schedule an interview! \nhttps://forms.gle/
