BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Fundraising
CATEGORIES:Fundraiser
CATEGORIES:Drop By
CATEGORIES:Casual/ Relaxed
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, our graduating class participates in a proud Class
  Gift tradition where members of the class invest in the University by su
 pporting areas of Montclair State University that are most important to t
 hem. We invite the Class of 2026 to come together to show your support!\n
 All gifts to Montclair count! Make your gift to any area of campus you fe
 el most passionate about – such as the Emergency Book Fund\, The Red Hawk
  Pantry\, your school or college\, The Fund for Montclair State or athlet
 ic program.\nYour gift will pay it forward for future Red Hawks and kick-
 start your philanthropic connection to Montclair.\n\nCommemorate your cla
 ss year! Make a gift of at least $20.26 and you’ll receive your customize
 d philanthropy cord to wear over your commencement robe. \nFor a gift of 
 $40\, celebrate this milestone with your family\, friends and colleagues 
 by having your message displayed on the screen at the Commencement you wi
 ll be participating in\, and receive a customized philanthropy cord.\n\nH
 ow do I get my customized philanthropy cord?\nCustomized philanthropy cor
 ds will be available for pick-up:\n\nMonday\, October 26 from 3:00 – 5:00
  p.m. in the Student Center Lobby\nThursday\, November 2nd  from 2:00 – 4
 :00 p.m. in the Student Center Lobby\nTuesday\, December 8 in the Student
  Center Lobby\n\nGraduates can also arrange to pick up their philanthropy
  cords in the Overlook Corporate Center\, 150 Clove Road\, Little Falls\,
  NJ during business hours\, Monday through Friday\, 8:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.
  Philanthropy cords can also be mailed to those who cannot pick it up. Pl
 ease contact James Stewart\, Associate Director of Annual Giving at stewa
 rtj@montclair.edu or 973-655-5328 to finalize options to get your cords f
 or the Winter Commencement.\nEvery student has benefitted from donor gene
 rosity to areas of academic support\, emergency funding for students and 
 overall priorities to boost students’ success every day. Thank you for pa
 ying it forward!For more information\, please contact James Stewart\, Ass
 ociate Director of Annual Giving\, at 973-655-5328 or stewartj@montclair.
 edu.\n\nHosted by: FAN: Future Alumni Network\n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12887129
DTEND:20261102T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052256Z
DTSTART:20261102T190000Z
LOCATION:Student Center 2C01 - 2nd Floor Lobby
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2026 Class Gift Tabling - Information and Philanthropy Cord Pick-Up
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12887129
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12887129
X-HOSTS:FAN: Future Alumni Network
END:VEVENT
