BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Civics
DESCRIPTION:Registered to vote using your campus address and need a ride t
 o the polls? Don’t sweat it—Civic and Voter Engagement has your back!\nOn
  Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, the Office of Civic and Voter Engagement w
 ill provide FREE shuttle transportation for students registered to vote u
 sing their campus address. Whether you're voting for the first time or ju
 st need a convenient way to get to your polling location\, we're here to 
 help!\nBE AT THE RED HAWK PARKING DECK BEFORE 2:00 PM!\nOur FREE Election
  Day shuttle departs at 2:00 PM. Check your polling location\, make your 
 voting plan\, and arrive on time!\nElection Day Information\n\n\nElection
  Day: Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\n\n\nPolling Hours: 6:00 AM – 8:00 PM\n
 \n\nShuttle Departure: 2:00 PM\n\n\nPickup Location: Outside the Red Hawk
  Parking Deck\n\n\nWho Can Ride: Students registered to vote using their 
 campus address\n\n\nPolling Locations\nSt. George's Antiochian Orthodox C
 hurch237 Long Hill Road\, Little Falls\, NJ\nFor students registered at B
 lanton Hall\, Dinallo Heights\, Hawks Crossing\, Machuga Heights\, Sinatr
 a Hall\, and The Village.\nSchool #5136 Valley Road\, Clifton\, NJ\nFor s
 tudents registered at Stone Hall and Bohn Hall.\nHow the Shuttle Works\nT
 he shuttle will make a full loop between both polling locations\, allowin
 g students time to cast their ballots before returning to campus.\n\n\nDe
 part from the Red Hawk Parking Deck at 2:00 PM.\n\n\nDrop students off at
  St. George's Antiochian Orthodox Church.\n\n\nContinue to School #5 in C
 lifton to drop off students.\n\n\nReturn to St. George's to pick up stude
 nts who have finished voting.\n\n\nStop again at School #5 to pick up ret
 urning students.\n\n\nReturn to the Red Hawk Parking Deck.\n\n\nCHECK YOU
 R POLLING PLACE BEFORE YOU GO!\nDon't guess where you vote—verify your as
 signed polling location before Election Day!\nVisit the official New Jers
 ey Polling Place Search\, enter your registered voting address\, and clic
 k “Submit” to find your polling place.\nhttps://voter.svrs.nj.gov/polling
 -place-search\nPLEASE NOTE: You cannot vote at just any polling location.
  You MUST vote at the polling place assigned to you based on your voter r
 egistration information. Please verify your polling location before board
 ing the shuttle to ensure you are traveling to the correct location.\nYOU
 R VOTE. YOUR VOICE. YOUR RIDE.\nDon't let transportation stand between yo
 u and the ballot box!\nCHECK YOUR POLLING PLACE. MAKE YOUR PLAN. BE AT TH
 E RED HAWK PARKING DECK BY 2:00 PM ON NOVEMBER 3!\nWe've got the ride cov
 ered—now it's your turn to show up!\n\nHosted by: Athletics\, Campus Acti
 vities\, Civic & Voter Engagement\, Residence Life\n\nAdditional Informat
 ion can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/129277
