DESCRIPTION:Registered to vote using your campus address and need a ride t
 o the polls? Don’t sweat it—Civic and Voter Engagement has your back!\nOn
  Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, the Office of Civic and Voter Engagement w
 ill provide FREE evening shuttle transportation for students registered t
 o vote using their campus address. Whether you're heading to the polls af
 ter class\, work\, or a busy day on campus\, we're here to help you get t
 here!\nELECTION DAY IS NOVEMBER 3 — DON'T MISS YOUR RIDE!\nBE AT THE RED 
 HAWK PARKING DECK BEFORE 6:00 PM!\nOur FREE Election Day evening shuttle 
 departs at 6:00 PM. Polling locations close at 8:00 PM\, so make sure you
  arrive on time and have your voting plan ready!\nElection Day Informatio
 n\n\n\nElection Day: Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\n\n\nPolling Hours: 6:00
  AM – 8:00 PM\n\n\nShuttle Departure: 6:00 PM\n\n\nPickup Location: Outsi
 de the Red Hawk Parking Deck\n\n\nWho Can Ride: Students registered to vo
 te using their campus address\n\n\nPolling Locations\nSt. George's Antioc
 hian Orthodox Church237 Long Hill Road\, Little Falls\, NJ\nFor students 
 registered at Blanton Hall\, Dinallo Heights\, Hawks Crossing\, Machuga H
 eights\, Sinatra Hall\, and The Village.\nSchool #5136 Valley Road\, Clif
 ton\, NJ\nFor students registered at Stone Hall and Bohn Hall.\nHow the S
 huttle Works\nThe shuttle will make a full loop between both polling loca
 tions\, allowing students time to cast their ballots before returning to 
 campus.\n\n\nDepart from the Red Hawk Parking Deck at 6:00 PM.\n\n\nDrop 
 students off at St. George's Antiochian Orthodox Church.\n\n\nContinue to
  School #5 in Clifton to drop off students.\n\n\nReturn to St. George's t
 o pick up students who have finished voting.\n\n\nStop again at School #5
  to pick up returning students.\n\n\nReturn to the Red Hawk Parking Deck.
 \n\n\nImportant: Polling locations close at 8:00 PM. Students who are in 
 line a head of the polls closing time do not leave as long as your in lin
 e before the closing time you are allowed to vote. \nCHECK YOUR POLLING P
 LACE BEFORE YOU GO!\nDon't guess where you vote—verify your assigned poll
 ing location before Election Day!\nVisit the official New Jersey Polling 
 Place Search\, enter your registered voting address\, and click “Submit” 
 to find your polling place.\nhttps://voter.svrs.nj.gov/polling-place-sear
 ch\nPLEASE NOTE: You cannot vote at just any polling location. You MUST v
 ote at the polling place assigned to you based on your voter registration
  information. Please verify your polling location before boarding the shu
 ttle to ensure you are traveling to the correct location.\nBusy day? We'v
 e got your evening ride covered!\nElection Day ends at 8:00 PM—make sure 
 you get to your assigned polling place in time!\n\nHosted by: Athletics\,
  Campus Activities\, Civic & Voter Engagement\, Residence Life\n\nAdditio
 nal Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/
 event/12922609
