DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting Midterm Election Night Party on Tuesda
 y\, November 3\, 2026\, from 7 to 10 p.m. in the Fish Bowl\, located in t
 he School of Communication and Media lobby!\nCome together with members o
 f the campus community to watch the midterm election results unfold in re
 al time. Follow the action and see who will prevail in New Jersey’s 12 U.
 S. House of Representatives districts\, while also keeping an eye on othe
 r key races from across the country.\nHosted by the Office of Civic and V
 oter Engagement\, the Department of Political Science and Law\, the Polit
 ical Science Club\, and the College of Humanities and Social Sciences\, t
 he event will offer a lively and welcoming space to discuss the races\, e
 xchange insights\, and experience democracy in action.\nWhether you close
 ly follow politics or simply want to enjoy the excitement of Election Nig
 ht\, this is a great opportunity to connect with others over pizza\, conv
 ersation\, and live results. Bring your friends and join us for an engagi
 ng evening as the nation decides the makeup of the next Congress!\n\nHost
 ed by: Campus Activities\, Civic & Voter Engagement\, Montclair State Uni
 versity Democrats\, Pre-Law Society\, Political Science Club\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/ev
 ent/12651231
