DESCRIPTION:Tuition is only part of what college costs. Between textbooks\
 , food\, housing\, and commuting\, the expenses add up.\nJoin us for a st
 udent listening session about the cost of being a student. Share your exp
 eriences\, ask questions about tuition\, fees\, and financial aid\, and t
 ell us which expenses are hardest to manage.\nWe want to hear what’s work
 ing\, what’s frustrating\, and what you wish the university understood ab
 out paying for college.\nThursday\, November 51:00-3:00 PMStudent Center\
 , Ballroom AMontclair Campus\nBring your questions\, concerns\, and ideas
 . Your experience matters.\n\nHosted by: Student Trustees \n\nAdditional 
 Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/even
 t/12913398
