DESCRIPTION:Learn where and how to find books\, articles\, and more! We’ll
  break down the differences between primary and secondary sources\; when 
 to use books vs. newspapers vs. scholarly journals vs. the internet\; and
  share search strategies so you are locating sources smarter (not harder)
