 colorful\, spooky\, or whimsical\, you'll design a one-of-a-kind creation
  that's uniquely yours. Perfect for getting creative and showing off your
  Halloween spirit\, or skipping the spooky altogether! Take-and-Make craf
 t kits are available for pick up at the Drop-In Center during business ho
 urs starting October 28th 2026. While supplies last! FREE for students wi
 th a valid Montclair or Bloomfield campus ID. Each craft kit includes a c
 eramic house\, acrylic paint\, and a paintbrush. \n\nHosted by: Office of
  Health Promotion\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://mont
 clair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12528236
