DESCRIPTION:The wedding may not be real\, but the celebration definitely i
 s! Join the Bangladesh Student Association for our Mock Bridal Shower & B
 achelor Party\, a fun-filled pre-wedding event where we'll celebrate our 
 mock bride and groom with laughter\, games\, music\, and unforgettable me
 mories.\nInspired by traditional South Asian pre-wedding festivities with
  a modern twist\, this event will feature exciting activities\, delicious
  food\, friendly competitions\, and plenty of opportunities to celebrate 
 with friends. Whether you're Team Bride or Team Groom\, come dressed to i
 mpress and enjoy an afternoon of culture\, community\, and pre-wedding fu
 n.\nGet ready to laugh\, make memories\, and kick off the excitement befo
 re our annual Mock Wedding. You won't want to miss one of the most entert
 aining events of the semester!\n\nHosted by: Bangladesh Student Associati
 on \, Pakistani Student Organization\, South Asian Student Association\n\
 nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com
 /engage/event/12914714
