CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:Come join us on a bike through the Paulinskill rail trail\, wh
 ich is flat and an easy trail for anyone. This trail used to be a railroa
 d and was made into a bike path. While biking\, you will be in the nice f
 all weather and enjoying the outdoors. (Biking experience required)\nHow 
 do I Sign-up?\n\n\nPlease register here\, or in the Student Rec Center ma
 in office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\n\n\nCost for Students  $10
 \n\n\nWhere and When?\n\n\nNovember 7th\, 2026\n\n\n9am - 5pm\n\n\nBegins
  Student Recreation Center\n\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, Lunch\, Long Pants
 \, Sneakers\, and Sunscreen.\nPotential Hazards: unpredictable weather ch
 anges\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poison
 ous plants\, insect bites\, injury by running including sprains\, lacerat
 ions\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditi
 onal Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage
 /event/12562474
