DESCRIPTION:Looking to change up your workout routine? This class combines
  strength\, toning\, and cardio exercises by targeting every major muscle
  group using weights\, resistance tubes\, and other fitness equipment to 
 provide a total body workout.\n \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistration is no
 t required.\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID\n\nWhere a
 nd When?\n\nEvery Wednesday\, Aug 31 - Dec 6\n3:30 p.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nStud
